# DE Desk design

Primary file: `client/src/components/ZohoASAPWidget.tsx`. Full playbook: `.cursor/skills/de-desk-ui/SKILL.md`. Authority: `design/DESIGN-AUTHORITY.md` — the **Logic** and **Copy** sections below are Tier 0 (every mode); the **Shell** and **Tab content** presentation is the Joe-decided Tier 2 direction (black + grey + gold panel, Joe 2026-10-01, superseding the white panel of 2026-09-28 / PR #277): mandatory in Maintenance Mode, challengeable only explicitly in Exploration Mode, shipped only by Joe.

## Shell (all tabs) — JOE-DECIDED current direction

- **One black + grey + gold panel** (Joe, 2026-10-01; `design/UI-STYLE-RULES.md` support chrome): `#0b0b0d` panel, charcoal rows and icon wells, white/10 hairline, white ink, all through the one `--desk-*` token set in the widget. A 1px gold cap on the panel; no glow, no gold ring, no second theme or `!important` override.
- The mark's Signal Gold `#E3B23C` (`--desk-gold`) for the avatar ring, active underline, send, CTAs, selected states and the incident rail, with near-black `--desk-on-gold` text on gold fills. No magenta anywhere on the Desk. Violet is lighting only and is not used here.
- Active tab: white label + gold underline.
- Composer, status strip, and repeated footer stay off Client Tools.

## Tab content

| Tab | Job |
|-----|-----|
| **Ask DE** | Conversational UI on the black panel. Composer dominant. Discovery chips. |
| **Get Support** | Gold-edged incident rail + focused issue list + charcoal form + gold submit. |
| **Client Tools** | Unauth: sign-in front door. Auth: Support / Secure services / Account launcher. Never a fake RMM or portal. |

Do not put Cyber Risk Assessment, billing, or a 2×2 grid on Client Tools.

## Copy (Tier 0)

- Label **functions**, not vendor products.
- Keep links/endpoints; change visible titles only.
- Portal login via `PORTAL_LOGIN` — never invent `//login`.

## Logic (Tier 0)

Preserve chat send/poll, agent live, ticket submit (fail-closed), resources links, analytics, ASAP bootstrap, cookie offset, `de-open-msp-advisor`, drag/resize/expand, unread/heads-up.

Composer is **Ask DE only**. Incoming replies on other tabs: heads-up + Ask DE badge.

Do not say “online” unless a human has joined. Do not add billing as a Desk choice.
